1|// Picture state for one scene: the pane card plus inline figures.
2|// The client sends ordinals and ids only, never text. Session caches
3|// survive sub-page and scene moves, so a shown picture never refetches.
4|//
5|// Ordering rules: one request at a time across scene and figure (a second
6|// request while one is in flight is a silent no-op); retryFigure only
7|// works from the error phase; the caller must call hidePopover on pager
8|// moves. The style pref arrives as a hook argument and is read through a
9|// ref, so the callbacks stay stable when it changes.
10|"use client";
